  "modifications": [
    "Replaced Cloudflare runtime base classes with local model stubs and a versioned, atomic local Workspace file transaction. The host owns identity and tool execution.",
    "Replaced cloud RPC and presence with a parent bridge bound to the current document inside an opaque-origin, CSP-restricted iframe. No author connections or cloud credentials are included.",
    "Translated editor controls and starter hints to Chinese, added accessible spreadsheet field labels, and exposed drafts including unsent field values.",
    "Stopped automatic conflict retries. Missing/corrupt documents fail closed instead of bootstrap/reset. Slides no longer reseed existing decks for theme versions.",
    "Preserved block/cell optimistic concurrency, invalidated cell versions after structural operations, acknowledged those versions to the client, and rejected deleted/recreated identity conflicts.",
    "Added source-owned offline HTML/print rendering, Markdown/CSV export, local operation receipts, draft recovery and host lifecycle handling in surrounding PAIMind code."
  ],
